  "policy": {
    "steed": "Native removable Reborn policy delegates the existing full-health/enchantment death-record return. No on-play grant or new death executor.",
    "thrasher": "Freeze the source printed Beast/Elemental Kindred query against the previous closed owner turn. When eligible, choose the original FIRE spell and grant its own local+2 before shared draw_one accepts a HAND draw, burn or actual CASTS_WHEN_DRAWN payload. Replacement draws do not acquire the original reward.",
    "local_spell_damage": "Granted stored SPELL ability is local to that physical spell. Capture complete abilities once at actual payload acceptance, retain across choices/repeats as appropriate, and share the existing ordinary/split/partition health budget; no global next-spell player aura.",
